    "ch5_s08_expedition_list": {
        "id": "ch5_s08_expedition_list",
        "title": "二十年前的遠征名冊",
        "chapter": 5,
        "chapterOrder": 8,
        "stageClass": "town_scene",
        "background": "civic archive with twenty-year expedition lists, Kaedren evidence, and the old seal-scar shard record",
        "worldState": "Chapter 5 late; run-specific town loss affects who is absent, not the historical evidence",
        "viewpoint": "protagonist_limited",
        "knowledgeBoundary": null,
        "participantsRaw": "village elder, town scholar",
        "entry": "four-front geometry is laid over the expedition route and local command records",
        "exit": "first run seeds elder's secret departure; second run exposes his preparations early",
        "objective": "reconstruct how the expedition reached and damaged the dragon-held perimeter",
        "inputsRaw": "four-front convergence; Kaedren record; Mia father tag; current run operation aftermath",
        "outputsRaw": "expedition truth; seal-scar context; elder departure/prevention chain",
        "assetNotes": "reuse archive/civic room; supreme commander remains clue-only inside mandatory scenes and receives no external-route art before approval",
        "beats": [
            {
                "order": 1,
                "condition": "any",
                "beat": "narration",
                "actorId": null,
                "expression": null,
                "text": "伊萊把遠征分成三層：村鎮自發的隊伍、凱德倫等地方線指揮，以及更前方尚未具名的總隊長。沒有一張紙能把三者簡化成同一個人。"
            },
            {
                "order": 2,
                "condition": "any",
                "beat": "enter",
                "actorId": "village_elder",
                "expression": null,
                "text": "Elder and town scholar enter; the protagonist remains through narration and questions.",
                "actorIds": [
                    "village_elder",
                    "town_scholar"
                ],
                "stageAction": "enter"
            },
            {
                "order": 3,
                "condition": "first_run",
                "beat": "narration",
                "actorId": null,
                "expression": null,
                "text": "他把預先印好的「安全通路」抬頭裁掉，只留下「最後可證實位置」，又將四份原頁、摘要與碎片收縮時間全部攤開，決定在天亮前重建每一處被省略的範圍。從米婭死後，那個字必須比他的手更慢。"
            },
            {
                "order": 4,
                "condition": "second_run",
                "beat": "narration",
                "actorId": null,
                "expression": null,
                "text": "新的處理頁在入夜前便完成歸檔，把樣本狀態、測試方法、適用範圍與未知項目留在同一欄。伊萊把它釘在舊摘要上，不讓修正抹掉曾經的錯。"
            },
            {
                "order": 5,
                "condition": "any",
                "beat": "speaker",
                "actorId": "town_scholar",
                "expression": "neutral",
                "text": "前段確實有勝利。路上的怪物被清掉，失聯點逐一往山裡推。這也是他們相信自己能處理下一道阻礙的原因。"
            },
            {
                "order": 6,
                "condition": "any",
                "beat": "speaker",
                "actorId": "village_elder",
                "expression": "grieving",
                "text": "我們到最外圍時，只看見龍、火和一條不讓人過的線。故鄉在後面壞掉，我們以為前面每個阻擋都在害它。"
            },
            {
                "order": 7,
                "condition": "any",
                "beat": "narration",
                "actorId": null,
                "expression": null,
                "text": "人類用工具與武力破壞外圍。封痕碎片從那次損傷落下，內側壓力與龍火同時爆發，遠征在兩者之間被摧毀。"
            },
            {
                "order": 8,
                "condition": "any",
                "beat": "speaker",
                "actorId": "village_elder",
                "expression": "guarded",
                "text": "龍沒有救我們，也不在乎為什麼來。牠們只看見一群拿武器的人把封住的地方再打開。"
            },
            {
                "order": 9,
                "condition": "any",
                "beat": "speaker",
                "actorId": "town_scholar",
                "expression": "guarded",
                "text": "這能證明人類造成過傷口，不能證明龍會相信下一個人類。還缺一條不去破壞寬路的辦法。"
            },
            {
                "order": 10,
                "condition": "any",
                "beat": "narration",
                "actorId": null,
                "expression": null,
                "text": "Mia 父親的補給編次停在外圍以前。他的最後位置仍不明，名冊沒有把個人失蹤硬塞進封痕答案。"
            },
            {
                "order": 11,
                "condition": "first_run",
                "beat": "narration",
                "actorId": null,
                "expression": null,
                "text": "老人把封痕碎片的收存欄默默合上。他的手停在米婭與芙蕾的名字旁，過了一會兒才把名冊推回伊萊面前。"
            },
            {
                "order": 12,
                "condition": "first_run",
                "beat": "speaker",
                "actorId": "village_elder",
                "expression": "soft",
                "text": "夠了。今天先到這裡。你們都該睡。"
            },
            {
                "order": 13,
                "condition": "second_run",
                "beat": "narration",
                "actorId": null,
                "expression": null,
                "text": "你注意到村長的靴底剛補過，乾糧少了一份，封痕碎片的收存欄也被提前清空。他正在準備獨自離開。"
            },
            {
                "order": 14,
                "condition": "second_run",
                "beat": "speaker",
                "actorId": "town_scholar",
                "expression": "guarded",
                "text": "你又想一個人去。二十年前是大家太相信人多，現在別用人少重演一次。"
            },
            {
                "order": 15,
                "condition": "any",
                "beat": "exit",
                "actorId": null,
                "expression": null,
                "text": "Seal-scar truth locks; open whistle cache and before-dawn town gate sequence."
            }
        ]
    },
